	"descriptionMarkdown": "That's perhaps my sexiest late-game ship for Aquilo powered by autism with 22 tiles width, 100 tiles height and 12 cargo bays. It relies heavily on lasers for small and medium asteroids with 2 railguns for the bigger ones. Because of that I highly recommend researching at least laser damage 10. It is powered with 2 fusion reactors and 8 plasma generators, both for the lasers, railgun ammo and fuel. It also means you gotta bring some fluoroketone and solar panels to start this thing up. Circuit logic ensures you don't have more than 100 ammo in your sorage (though you could change that if you want). There's a lot of circuit logic for other stuff too, one of them being limiting amount of fuel you burn to maximize fuel efficiency and liqhts to visualize fuel/water/ammo for... well, it looks cool. If you find any issues with this design, please let me know, it's fairly new and a subject to change. Other than that, enjoy :)",
